From 9fb567cd734a883618f092898616e7a031154696 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] sovereignos: boot picture assets (ADR-152)

Replace the two textures of the built-in boot renderer: a full-screen lighthouse picture with a transparent window
for the loading bar, and the texture that scrolls behind it. Generated by branding/boot in sovereignos-platform.
The texture is 256 rows high: the renderer lines a texture up with the bottom edge of the mask.
---
 core/res/assets/images/android-logo-mask.png  | Bin 7046 -> 1222521 bytes
 core/res/assets/images/android-logo-shine.png | Bin 456087 -> 556 bytes
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

